# Backend & Database Rules (.mdc)

- **Primary Cloud Database:** Supabase PostgreSQL for relational integrity, ACID compliance, and secure data storage.
- **Offline-First Caching:** Room Database (`@Entity`, `@Dao`, AppDatabase) for offline performance and local caching.
- **Repository Pattern:** Abstract all data sources behind repository interfaces in the domain layer.
- **Security & Authorization:** Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) enforced server-side via Supabase policies and client-side authorization checks.
